abstract: >-
  Interactive educational model of the DOBOT MG400 developed with MATLAB,
  Simulink, Simscape, and Simscape Multibody. The model provides interactive
  control of the four independent joints and reproduces the auxiliary joint
  relationships defined in the official MG400 URDF. The current release is
  intended for prescribed-motion kinematic visualization and educational use.
